{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35418","headline":"汉武帝於宫中宴西王母 · 曹唐","name":"汉武帝於宫中宴西王母","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鳌岫云低太一坛，武皇斋洁不胜懽。\n长生碧字期亲署，延寿丹泉许细看。\n劒佩有声宫树静，星河无影禁花寒。\n秋风褭褭月朗朗，玉女清歌一夜阑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹唐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35418.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35418","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}